DESCRIPTION:The Turkish Student Association at Indiana University will hos
 t its annual Republic Day Celebration\, our signature and historically la
 rgest event. This year marks the 103rd anniversary of the founding of the
  Turkish Republic by Mustafa Kemal Atatürk. The celebration will feature 
 a cultural reception that brings together students\, scholars\, alumni\, 
 and professionals from Bloomington and surrounding cities such as Terre H
 aute\, Indianapolis\, and Kentucky. By honoring history and fostering fel
 lowship\, the event strengthens community ties and promotes Turkish cultu
 re within and beyond IU.\n\nHosted by: Turkish Student Association at Ind
 iana University\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvo
 lved.indiana.edu/event/12910386
DTEND:20261101T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20261031T052043Z
DTSTART:20261031T220000Z
LOCATION:IMU Tudor Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Republic Day of Turkey Celebration
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12910386
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12910386
X-HOSTS:Turkish Student Association at Indiana University
