DESCRIPTION: \nWhen: Tuesday November 3rd\, 5:00–6:00pmWhere:\nDMPC is a c
 reative space for students who make music on a computer\, or want to star
 t. FL Studio\, Ableton\, Logic\, GarageBand: whatever you use\, or even i
 f you’ve never opened a DAW.\nAt the callout:\n\nShow what weekly meeting
 s will look like: feedback circles\, collabs\, beat-making challenges\, a
 nd creative games\nShare open exec board positions\, if you want to help 
 shape the club from day one\nAnnounce our first beat challenge/activity\n
 \nAfter the callout\, we’ll meet every Tuesday at 5pm.\nBring headphones 
 and a laptop if you have them\, but you don’t need to. And bring a friend
  who makes music\, or wants to.\nJoin our GroupMe to stay in the loop: ht
 tps://groupme.com/join_group/116874010/Yh1hwhbT\nQuestions? Email devnand
 a@iu.edu.\nSee you there!Devan Nanda\, President\, Digital Music Producti
 on Club\n\nHosted by: Digital Music Production Club\n\nAdditional Informa
 tion can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12927076
