DESCRIPTION:Join the Alzheimer’s Student Alliance for our General Body Mee
 tings! These meetings are a welcoming space for students to connect\, lea
 rn\, and get involved in raising awareness about Alzheimer’s disease and 
 supporting those affected by it.\nEach meeting will feature opportunities
  to learn about Alzheimer’s and brain health\, participate in meaningful 
 discussions and activities\, hear about upcoming events and initiatives\,
  and connect with other students who are passionate about making a differ
 ence.\nNo experience or prior knowledge is required—just bring your curio
 sity and a willingness to get involved! Whether you’re interested in advo
 cacy\, community outreach\, education\, research\, or simply want to lear
 n more\, there’s a place for you in ALZSA.\n\nHosted by: Alzheimer's Stud
 ent Alliance at Indiana University\n\nAdditional Information can be found
  at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12618766
