DESCRIPTION:Middle Way House Club at Indiana University is hosting a discu
 ssion about the culture of sexual violence on campus and about skills tha
 t build safety and accountability in our community. We want to hold compa
 ssion and care together as emotions around rape culture continue to rise.
  We know as our institutions around us continue to fail and not provide s
 afety\, we have to keep our own community safe. During this event we will
  build the skills of accountability\, safety planning\, bystander interve
 ntion and more. Join us Tuesday the 3rd at 6:00 pm!\n \n \n\nHosted by: M
 iddle Way House Club at IU\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: htt
 ps://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12940901
