DESCRIPTION:How do you understand if you are dealing with stress? There wi
 ll be a basic discussion about types of stress\, manifestation in body an
 d mind. This time was intended to help the student to have a deeper under
 standing of self\, community and environment around them. Hye Ree earned 
 her Doctor of Psychology (Psy.D.) degree in Clinical Psychology with a fo
 cus on traumatic stress psychology from Adler University in Chicago. Hye 
 Ree serves as an embedded counselor at the ACC. \n \nAll Indiana Universi
 ty events\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and histor
 ical observances welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana
  University community.\n\nHosted by: Asian Culture Center\n\nAdditional I
