DESCRIPTION:Come spend your Thursdays at the ACC practicing your Tagalog a
 nd celebrating Filipino culture! Every Thursday from 5:00-6:00 PM\, we'll
  host a variety of language-immersive events with Kenneth P. De la Piedra
 \, EdD —(included but not limited to) language table\, speech practice\, 
 Tagalog tutoring\, cooking workshops—to introduce the aspects that Filipi
 no culture has to offer. Tara\, Mag-Tagalog Tayo! is open to everyone\, w
 hether you’re a beginner\, fluent speaker\, or simply curious about Filip
 ino culture. \n \nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, a
 nd educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU stu
 dents and other members of the Indiana University community.\n\nHosted by
 : Asian Culture Center\, Filipino American Association at IU\n\nAdditiona
 l Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12842
 785
