DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Mindful Medics at IU. We are a Pre-Health Organizat
 ion here at IU. Our goal is to provide support and create a network of Pr
 e-Health Students on campus with no additional pressure on your busy live
 s! Every week we will have a study room available to any Pre-Health stude
 nts\, lots of whiteboards\, whiteboard markers\, and the chance to meet p
 eople in your classes\, or be a place for your study group to get togethe
 r. Our weekly study nights may include snacks\, tea\, mindful moments\, a
 nd more.\n \nWe are here to help you and are open to your suggestions!\n 
 \nBe on the lookout for our other events:\nYOGA NIGHT!PREMED WORKSHOP!MCA
 T JEOPARDY!WORD CLOUD!\n\nHosted by: Mindful Medics at IU\n\nAdditional I
 nformation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12675839
