DESCRIPTION:Union Board’s Out & About committee is heading underground\, a
 nd we’re taking 50 students with us to Marengo Cave\, completely free of 
 charge!\nMeet at the IMU Biddle Hotel Lobby by 12:00 PM\, where we'll dri
 ve everyone down to Marengo Cave in southern Indiana. Once there\, you’ll
  take the Dripstone Tour\, a guided one-mile walk through the cave that t
 akes about an hour. Snacks and bottled water provided. When the tour wrap
 s up\, we’ll bring you back to the IMU by around 5:30 PM.\nNo caving expe
 rience needed. Just bring a jacket\, since it stays cool underground all 
 year.\nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and educatio
 nal\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU students and o
 ther members of the Indiana University community.\n \n \nAll Indiana Univ
 ersity events\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and hi
 storical observances welcome all IU students and other members of the Ind
 iana University community.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Union Board\n\n
 Additional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/ev
 ent/12940031
