DESCRIPTION:The National Day of Service started in 2012 and has become one
  of the key initiatives led by NALFO and its members. The theme for the N
 DOS is “UP!” which means Unidos con Proposito / United with Purpose.\nIn 
 coming together for a day such as this we anticipate fostering community 
 but more importantly to make a meaningful collective impact. Our organiza
 tions are so very powerful on their own\, but united\, the realm of possi
 bilities is truly limitless. We set forth big goals and we count on our m
 ember organizations and community members to  ensure our projects are ful
 l with volunteers.\n\nHosted by: La Unidad Latina\, Lambda Upsilon Lambda
  Fraternity\, Inc.\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://bei
 nvolved.indiana.edu/event/12933641
