DESCRIPTION:\nExec-Site Leader Retreat on Sunday\, November 8\, from 12:30
 –2:30 PM\, and attendance is mandatory for all site leaders!\nThe goal is
  to help everyone get to know each other and our members on Exec\, prepar
 e you for your upcoming trips and your role as a site leader\, and make s
 ure you feel confident handling different situations that may come up. We
 ’ll go through potential trip scenarios\, talk through how to handle chal
 lenges\, leave time for questions\, and have some social time with fun ac
 tivities so we can get to know each other better!\n\nHosted by: Alternati
 ve Break Program\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinv
 olved.indiana.edu/event/12936050
