DESCRIPTION:Taste Around the Runway is an event that brings together diffe
 rent cultures through food and fashion! We are creating a global food mar
 ket where students can walk around and try traditional foods from differe
 nt countries and cultures. Each student will receive food tickets to expl
 ore different stations and try a variety of dishes. Along with the food m
 arket\, we will have a cultural fashion show where students and cultural 
 organizations can showcase traditional clothing from their cultures and s
 hare the meaning and history behind them. All Indiana University events\,
  groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical observ
 ances welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana University
  community.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Union Board\n\nAdditional Info
 rmation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12934394
