X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
CATEGORIES:Academic/Career
DESCRIPTION:\nTHE BUSINESS COLLECTIVEBuild Your Network. Explore Your Opti
 ons. Prepare for What's Next.\n \nDesigned specifically for pre-business 
 students\, the Business Collective connects students with upperclassmen\,
  IU alumni\, employers\, and career coaches who can help them navigate th
 e pre-business experience and explore what's possible beyond it.\n \nEach
  virtual session offers a different perspective\, giving students access 
 to people who can share candid advice\, expand their understanding of car
 eer possibilities\, and help them prepare for future opportunities.\n \n\
 nNOVEMBER 10: EXPLORE YOUR OPTIONS\nCareers Aren't Straight Lines. See wh
 ere business can take you.\n \nMeet IU alumni working across different ar
 eas of business and hear the real stories behind how they got from IU to 
 where they are today—including the decisions\, experiences\, connections\
 , and unexpected turns that shaped their careers.\n \nStudents will:\nDis
 cover business career paths they may not have considered.\nHear how alumn
 i translated their IU experiences into careers.\nLearn why career paths r
 arely follow a perfectly straight line.\nDiscover how networking can be u
 sed to explore careers and gather information—not simply ask for jobs.\nA
 ttend all three sessions to earn a Business Collective certificate.\n\nHo
 sted by: Undergraduate Education\n\nAdditional Information can be found a
 t: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12759808
DTEND:20261110T213000Z
DTSTAMP:20261031T052043Z
DTSTART:20261110T203000Z
LOCATION:Online
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The Business Collective: Explore Your Options
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12759808
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12759808
X-HOSTS:Undergraduate Education
END:VEVENT
