 mfortable in front of an audience. It now has over 350\,000 members in ne
 arly 17\,000 clubs in 143 countries\, offering a proven\, and enjoyable\,
  way to improve communication and leadership skills.\nKSB Toastmasters me
 ets Tuesdays from 8:00 - 9:00pm! Further announcements like room number a
 nd time-sensitive information will be provided in the GroupMe. \n\nHosted
  by: Toastmasters at the Kelley School of Business\n\nAdditional Informat
 ion can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12677200
