DESCRIPTION:Thinking About Taking a T-Break?\nWhether you're looking to re
 set your relationship with cannabis\, lower your tolerance\, or simply ta
 ke a mindful pause\, this workshop is for you. Join us for an informative
  and supportive session where we'll explore what a cannabis tolerance bre
 ak is\, why it can be beneficial\, and practical strategies for making yo
 ur T-break successful. We'll discuss what to expect\, how to manage commo
 n challenges\, and ways to stay motivated throughout the process. Partici
 pants will leave with evidence-informed tools\, a personalized plan\, and
  the confidence to take the next step toward their goals—without judgment
  and at their own pace.\n\nHosted by: Collegiate Recovery Community\n\nAd
 ditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/even
 t/12544651
DTEND:20261112T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20261031T052043Z
