DESCRIPTION:Join us for food and fun at Bridgework\, a monthly leadership 
 and team-building series designed to helps students strengthen their abil
 ity to collaborate in their organizations and communities.\nWhether you'r
 e leading a student org\, supporting a team\, or just getting started\, B
 ridgework offers practical tools and powerful insights to help you build 
 better bridges—between people\, ideas\, and action.\n📅 November 11th\, 2
 026⏰ 6:00 PM – 8:30 PM📍 IMU Solarium\n \nThe last 30 minutes of this eve
 nt will be dedicated to student leader training for those attending to fu
 lfill their 2026 Student Leader Summit requirements. Students attending f
 or this purpose must attend the full event in addition to these 30 minute
 s to receive credit.\n \nBridgework Takeovers\nIs your student organizati
 on looking for a specific topic to be covered during one of our eight ses
 sions? Suggest a topic by emailing hwienke@iu.edu. A takeover does not ma
 ke your workshop exclusive to your group but it does make it more customi
 zed to your group's needs. Takeovers are exclusive to one group per Bridg
 ework event and include: choice of topics and choice of activities and ga
 mes. \nNovember Takeover Group: Unclaimed\n \nAll Indiana University even
 ts\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical ob
 servances welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana Univer
 sity community.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Union\, Student Involvemen
 t and Leadership\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinv
 olved.indiana.edu/event/12630645
