 community\, culture\, and connections! Join us for cake\, ice cream\, and
  fun goodies as we honor this special milestone. Stop by\, even if just f
 or a little while\, we love to see you on this very special day.\n\nHoste
 d by: La Casa/Latino Cultural Center\n\nAdditional Information can be fou
 nd at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12504332
