 hips\, and self-expression can shape the ways we understand art and its h
 istories. Whether you’re an art enthusiast or simply curious\, come explo
 re\, ask questions\, and discover new ways of looking at familiar and per
 haps unfamiliar works. Pease make sure to RSVP to the event if you are in
