DESCRIPTION:Join A Kid Again for our biweekly meeting!\nA Kid Again IU is 
 one of three Collegiate Chapters that have been serving families for over
  25 years. A Kid Again gives families with a child facing a life-threaten
 ing diagnosis a chance to create unique memories through free monthly Adv
 entures and fun events. As a collegiate chapter\, our support comes in th
 ree ways: volunteering\, philanthropy\, and outreach. \nLearn about upcom
 ing club events\, volunteer opportunities in the community\, and connect 
 with other IU students!\nWe hope to see you there! :)\n\nHosted by: A Kid
  Again IU\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.i
 ndiana.edu/event/12500014
