DESCRIPTION:These events will be PhotoFocus's weekly meetings where we com
 e together to create and learn as a community. A few examples of meetings
  include\, edit-offs where everyone works from the same RAW photo and sha
 res their editing style and approach. Critique nights\, giving members co
 nstructive feedback on composition\, lighting and overall photo execution
 . Photo walks\, exploring campus and local areas to practice photography 
 in the real world. Each meeting is designed to strengthen members' skills
  and foster a supportive community of photographers. \n\nHosted by: Photo
 Focus Photography Club\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https:/
