CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
DESCRIPTION:The purpose of this event is to promote safe drinking and harm
  reduction ahead of Blackout Wednesday by providing students with educati
 onal resources and safety supplies. The event will focus on educating stu
 dents about the risks of excessive alcohol consumption\, recognizing sign
 s of alcohol poisoning\, looking out for friends\, and planning safe tran
 sportation. Free giveaways and informational materials will be used to en
 courage student engagement and promote a safer campus community during th
 e holiday weekend. All Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, 
 educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU studen
 ts and other members of the Indiana University community. \n\nHosted by: 
 Culture of Care\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvo
 lved.indiana.edu/event/12920633
