 ucational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU students
  and other members of the Indiana University community.\n\nHosted by: Ind
 iana Memorial Union\, Student Involvement and Leadership\n\nAdditional In
 formation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12629561
