DESCRIPTION:\n\nTHE BUSINESS COLLECTIVEBuild Your Network. Explore Your Op
 tions. Prepare for What's Next.\nDesigned specifically for pre-business s
 tudents\, the Business Collective connects students with upperclassmen\, 
 IU alumni\, employers\, and career coaches who can help them navigate the
  pre-business experience and explore what's possible beyond it.\n \nEach 
 virtual session offers a different perspective\, giving students access t
 o people who can share candid advice\, expand their understanding of care
 er possibilities\, and help them prepare for future opportunities.\n \n\n
 DECEMBER 1: PREPARE FOR WHAT'S NEXT\nInside the Recruiter's Room. Find ou
 t what employers really notice.\n \nStep inside the recruiter's perspecti
 ve and hear directly from professionals who evaluate emerging talent. Lea
 rn what helps students stand out and what you can begin doing now—even if
  you're still building experience.\n \nStudents will:\nHear what recruite
 rs notice when reviewing early-career candidates.\nLearn how campus jobs\
 , involvement\, projects\, and other experiences build valuable skills.\n
 Discover how to communicate their experiences with greater confidence.\nG
 et practical advice about what they can start doing now to prepare for fu
 ture opportunities.\n \nAttend all three sessions to earn a Business Coll
 ective certificate.\n\nHosted by: Undergraduate Education\n\nAdditional I
 nformation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12759806
DTEND:20261201T213000Z
DTSTAMP:20261031T052043Z
DTSTART:20261201T203000Z
LOCATION:Online
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The Business Collective: Prepare for What's Next
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12759806
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12759806
X-HOSTS:Undergraduate Education
