 aries as student leaders. Come out for our last session of the semester!\
 nThe Mentor Apprenticeship Program (MAP) is a two-semester training serie
 s facilitated by the FASE Mentoring Program. It gives students at IU Bloo
 mington opportunities to enhance their mentoring\, teamwork\, and leaders
 hip skills. Upon completion of MAP\, students receive a Certificate of Co
 mpletion\, which establishes their commitment to growth and leadership.\n
 All Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, c
