DESCRIPTION:The term Mehendi is the Indian word for Henna\, and it is also
  the term used to describe the art of applying henna. Come and learn the 
 basic designs and application techniques of Henna or Mehendi\, which is u
 sed to create temporary tattoos. Please feel free to bring your friends t
 o learn more about Desi culture and the significance of Mehendi in the In
 dian culture! If you come with a group of more than 7 members\, please em
 ail acc@iu.edu in advance so we can prepare the henna materials.   \n \nA
 ll Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cu
 ltural\, and historical observances welcome all IU students and other mem
 bers of the Indiana University community.\n \n\nHosted by: Asian Culture 
 Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indi
 ana.edu/event/12554986
