DESCRIPTION:Join us for food and fun at Bridgework\, a monthly leadership 
 and team-building series designed to helps students strengthen their abil
 ity to collaborate in their organizations and communities.\nWhether you'r
 e leading a student org\, supporting a team\, or just getting started\, B
 ridgework offers practical tools and powerful insights to help you build 
 better bridges—between people\, ideas\, and action.\n📅 January 20th\, 20
 27⏰ 6:00 PM – 8:00 PM📍 IMU Frangipani Room\n \nBridgework Takeovers\nIs 
 your student organization looking for a specific topic to be covered duri
 ng one of our eight sessions? Suggest a topic by emailing hwienke@iu.edu.
  A takeover does not make your workshop exclusive to your group but it do
 es make it more customized to your group's needs. Takeovers are exclusive
  to one group per Bridgework event and include: choice of topics and choi
 ce of activities and games. \nJanuary Takeover Group: Unclaimed\n \nAll I
 ndiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultur
 al\, and historical observances welcome all IU students and other members
  of the Indiana University community.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Unio
 n\, Student Involvement and Leadership\n\nAdditional Information can be f
 ound at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12630883
DTEND:20270121T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20261031T052043Z
DTSTART:20270120T230000Z
