DESCRIPTION:Become a Recovery Ally!\nJoin us for Recovery Ally Training an
 d learn how to support individuals impacted by substance use with compass
 ion\, understanding\, and evidence-based knowledge. This interactive trai
 ning will help participants reduce stigma\, recognize opportunities to of
 fer support\, and connect people to recovery resources in their communiti
 es.\nWhether you're a community member\, family member\, professional\, s
 tudent\, or someone passionate about making a difference\, this training 
 will equip you with practical tools to become a confident ally for recove
 ry.\n\nHosted by: Collegiate Recovery Community\n\nAdditional Information
  can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12544601
